# What stays OUT of the published .vsix. Anything not matched here ships —
# so the test workspace, coverage report, and dev tooling MUST be listed,
# otherwise they bloat (and leak) the package. Keep this tight: the vsix
# should contain only dist/, media/, snippets.json, and the docs.

# ── Dev tooling / editor config ──
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
.github/**
out/**
node_modules/**
src/**
.gitignore
.yarnrc
esbuild.js
Makefile
vsc-extension-quickstart.md
**/tsconfig.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/*.map
**/*.ts
**/.vscode-test.*

# ── Test fixture workspace (a full Django app + .venv — ~3900 files) ──
test-django-cotton/**

# ── Generated / local-only artifacts ──
coverage/**
*.vsix

# ── README assets: served from GitHub via absolute URLs, not bundled ──
images/**

# ── Internal docs / source assets not for end users ──
PLAN.md
CLAUDE.md
icon.svg
